what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Simple, transparent pricing</span>\n    <h1>Plans that fit the way you work</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Start free, upgrade when you need more room, or bring your team together.</p>\n    <p class=\"muted\">Monthly billing. Change or cancel your plan anytime.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\" aria-label=\"Pricing plans\">\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Free</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">A solid start for personal projects and exploring the essentials.</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n          <span class=\"h1\">$0</span>\n          <span class=\"muted\">/ month</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Free forever. No credit card required.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"#get-started-free\">Get started free</a>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"h4\">What’s included</h3>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <li>✓ 3 projects</li>\n          <li>✓ Core planning and tracking tools</li>\n          <li>✓ Up to 2 collaborators</li>\n          <li>✓ 1 GB of file storage</li>\n          <li>✓ Community support</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h2 class=\"h3\">Pro</h2>\n          <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">More flexibility and insight for people doing their best work.</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n          <span class=\"h1\">$19</span>\n          <span class=\"muted\">/ month</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Per person, billed monthly.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-block\" href=\"#choose-pro\">Choose Pro</a>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"h4\">Everything in Free, plus</h3>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <li>✓ Unlimited projects</li>\n          <li>✓ Up to 10 collaborators</li>\n          <li>✓ 100 GB of file storage</li>\n          <li>✓ Advanced reports and dashboards</li>\n          <li>✓ Automations and custom workflows</li>\n          <li>✓ Priority email support</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Team</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Shared visibility and control for teams working toward bigger goals.</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n          <span class=\"h1\">$49</span>\n          <span class=\"muted\">/ month</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Per team, billed monthly. Includes up to 10 members.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\" href=\"#choose-team\">Choose Team</a>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"h4\">Everything in Pro, plus</h3>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <li>✓ Shared team workspace</li>\n          <li>✓ Unlimited team projects</li>\n          <li>✓ 1 TB of shared file storage</li>\n          <li>✓ Roles and access controls</li>\n          <li>✓ Team activity and workload reports</li>\n          <li>✓ Dedicated team support</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card row between center gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">Not sure which plan is right?</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Start with Free and upgrade whenever you’re ready. Your work stays with you.</p>\n    </div>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"#get-started-free\">Explore Free</a>\n  </section>\n</main>","deltas":[[2670,"<"],[2679,"main"],[2686," class"],[2690,"=\""],[2695,"page"],[2827," stack"],[2827," gap"],[2827,"-lg"],[2827,"\">\n"],[2827," "],[2827," <"],[2827,"header"],[2827," class"],[2827,"=\""],[2827,"stack"],[2827," gap"],[2827,"-sm"],[2827,"\">\n"],[2827,"   "],[2827," <"],[2827,"span"],[2828," class"],[2828,"=\""],[2828,"badge"],[2828," badge"],[2828,"-secondary"],[2828,"\">"],[2828,"Simple"],[2828,","],[2828," transparent"],[2828," pricing"],[2828,"</"],[2828,"span"],[2828,">\n"],[2832,"   "],[2832," <"],[2832,"h"],[2832,"1"],[2832,">"],[2832,"Plans"],[2832," that"],[2843," fit"],[2847," the"],[2862," way"],[2864," you"],[2869," work"],[2872,"</"],[2876,"h"],[2876,"1"],[2876,">\n"],[2877,"   "],[2889," <"],[2895,"p"],[3005," class"],[3005,"=\""],[3005,"lead"],[3005,"\">"],[3005,"Start"],[3005," free"],[3005,","],[3005," upgrade"],[3005," when"],[3005," you"],[3005," need"],[3005," more"],[3023," room"],[3047,","],[3059," or"],[3072," bring"],[3081," your"],[3083," team"],[3086," together"],[3094,".</"],[3100,"p"],[3102,">\n"],[3103,"   "],[3118," <"],[3120,"p"],[3123," class"],[3123,"=\""],[3150,"mut"],[3154,"ed"],[3154,"\">"],[3172,"Monthly"],[3185," billing"],[3195,"."],[3208," Change"],[3242," or"],[3259," cancel"],[3264," your"],[3264," plan"],[3265," anytime"],[3273,".</"],[3279,"p"],[3285,">\n"],[32